@node no1 " Introduction"

This Door is for you, Sysop...
It should be protect your BBS against MultiUser Monster Chats, hehe
For shure you know the Proble, it is the best Caller Time an some crazy
Dudez are blokking your BBS with an Monster MultiUser Chat...
This Program allows you and your Cosysop to restrict specified Users from
the MultiUser Chat.

have phun with the door...
[-Dr.Dre!/tRSi]

@endnode
@node no2 " Requirements"

You need an Amiga 500/1000/2000/3000 (The Sysops with an A4ooo or A12oo 
should call my BBS to receive an uncompiled Version)
Kickstart 2.0 or higher
Ami Express 2.xx - 3.xx (Registered)
An running RPStart
rexxplsextnd.library
Rexxplslib.library
rexxsyslib.library
rexxsupport.library
in your Libs: but they are included

Thats all...

@endnode
@node no3 " Installation"

First copy all Libs: (If you dont have them allready) into your libs: Dir
Copy the Chat.info and the MultiUserChat.Info to your BBS:Commands/bbscmd/
and make shure you run rpstart in your Startup-Sequence.
Then create a Directory called ChatAx in your Doors...
There you copy all Files and Dirs from the Archive Directory 
BBS/Doors/ChatAx/

There must be in all this Files and Dirs...

Chat.no                       67 (The DataFile with all restricted Users)
Chatax.aim                 63588 (The Door self)
chat.cfg                       4 (The Config File)
ChatAx.Guide                6435 (The Guide File)

After this jump into the Chat.Cfg File and change the Level...

------------------cut here------------------
253
------------------cut here------------------
Line.1=All Users with this Level (or higher) is it allowed to restrict
       another Guys from the Chat...
       may it is better to enable this Option only for Sysop`s

Now edit in your bbscmd the MultiUserChat.Info and change the Location
to your original MultiChatTool...

This is all what you have to do...

@endnode
